  "bodyHash": "f1b75a414fe266cc",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GUI 時鐘是一款極簡風格的客戶端模組，當背包中有時鐘時，會在螢幕介面上顯示時間。它可以顯示遊戲內時間或現實時間，支援 24 小時制或上午/下午格式。它還可以在時間下方顯示世界建立的天數。除了以數字顯示時間外，也可以改為在螢幕上顯示時鐘圖示，此功能可在設定檔中啟用。<br><br>預設情況下，當玩家有藥水效果時，時鐘會自動降低位置。</span><br><br></p>\n<p>您也可能對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gui-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI 指南針</a></strong></span> 感興趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的客戶端套裝\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForGameTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用後，僅在背包中有時鐘時顯示遊戲內時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用後，僅在背包中有時鐘時顯示現實時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家有藥水效果時，是否應降低 GUI 時鐘的位置以防止重疊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_24hourformat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將時鐘格式設為 24 小時制。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，將顯示時鐘物品圖示而非數字時鐘。若使用 Quark 模組，必須停用「Clock Nerf」功能才能正常運作。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showBothTimes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">同時顯示遊戲內時間與當地現實時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;顯示實際當地時間，取代遊戲內時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTimeSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在時鐘中顯示秒數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDaysPlayedWorld</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">顯示在世界中的遊玩天數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘置於左側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsCenter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘置於中間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsRight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘置於右側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockHeightOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 5, min 0, max 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的垂直偏移量（Y 軸座標）。這決定了時間在螢幕上的下降距離。可調整此值以防止介面重疊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockWidthOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 0, min -3000, max 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的水平偏移量（X 軸座標）。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在顯示的文字下方繪製陰影。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的紅色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的綠色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 255, min 0, max 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的藍色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小時制時鐘。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"356\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12 小時制時鐘。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小時制時鐘搭配電腦當地時間。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>天數計數器：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"160\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>並啟用設定選項「<em>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</em>」時：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"736\" height=\"166\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用設定選項「lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects」後，當藥水效果觸發時，時鐘會自動降低：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"476\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模組，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a> 反映。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
